          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 391,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.100:block:1",
          "start": 365
        },
        "quote": "(b) Unauthorized Presence.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.100:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.100 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "b3e8d60e-4dde-52d3-bb1f-a61481b748da",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 677,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.100:block:2",
          "start": 392
        },
        "quote": "(1) It shall be unlawful for any person in any school room where any public school is assembled, or in or about any building which is used for public school purposes or on the grounds or approaches adjacent thereto, to disturb or interrupt the peace, good order or quiet of the school.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.100:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.100 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "c3fc5551-48ca-5ae0-bbd6-5dd4c7f9ba26",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1061,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.100:block:3",
          "start": 678
        },
        "quote": "(2) It shall be unlawful for any person not in immediate attendance upon the school and being in such building, or upon the premises belonging thereto, while the school is in session, or while the school or premises are being used either for school purposes or activities, to conduct or behave himself improperly, or to interrupt the peace, good order or quietude of such activities.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.100:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.100 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "78c20cb5-644f-531e-be34-a1ccf247fbbb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1082,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.100:block:4",
          "start": 1062
        },
        "quote": "(c) Notice to Leave.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.100:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.100 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "f60f7f5b-5c24-5a43-b918-5e392ed6fa45",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1491,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.100:block:5",
          "start": 1083
        },
        "quote": "(1) It shall be unlawful for any person, upon the request of a teacher, custodian or security personnel of any public school, or any person in charge thereof, to refuse or neglect to leave the building or premises. It shall further be unlawful to return to the building or premises after having been so notified to leave the premises, without first obtaining a pass from the proper authorities in the school.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.100:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.100 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "a8b14655-84b9-54eb-81d9-0e874bb01490",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1901,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.100:block:6",
          "start": 1492
        },
        "quote": "(2) It shall be unlawful for any person who has been requested to leave the school property or building by any teacher, custodian, security personnel or person in charge thereof, when such property is posted in such a manner as to reasonably come to the attention of all parties, to reenter the premises without the specific written approval of the school authorities. (Code 1981 § 15-64. Code 1995 § 54-131.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.100:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
